   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49G8

   1 a 0000 E49G8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P4] `>= ' with literal LEFT, member RIGHT, equal
   4 a 0006      attributes.  Written order again per the ORDER law, so both
   5 a 0006      template hypotheses coincide on the direct head; collapse and
   6 a 0006      skip byte are the open bytes.  Completion of the 4-relations x
   7 a 0006      2-orientations literal matrix at equal attributes. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if 'ABC' >= rec.na then k = 1;
  15 c 001B   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003D   stop;
  17 a 0040 end E49G8;

CODE SIZE = 0040
DATA AREA = 000F
FREE SYMS = 386E
END  COMPILATION
